  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Undercover Travel Vest is crafted for the discerning tactical traveler who values functionality and discretion. With its dozen multi-functional utility pockets, this vest ensures you can carry everything you need securely and conveniently.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2434",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Undercover Travel Vest is crafted for the discerning tactical traveler who values functionality and discretion. With its dozen multi-functional utility pockets, this vest ensures you can carry everything you need securely and conveniently. The travel vest features wire pass-through ports for headphones, allowing you to stay connected while on the move. A dedicated tablet-sized pocket keeps your electronic devices safe and accessible. Moreover, a hidden passport pocket tucked inside provides added security for essential documents. Made from durable poly/cotton material blends, this outdoor vest offers long-lasting comfort for all your travels. Whether you're navigating bustling airports or exploring new destinations, Rothco's Undercover Travel Vest is your trusted companion for staying organized and prepared.</p>",
